- **B2 (already failed):** No record of this assertion failing. The only run of the sibling script passed (`tools/bench/diag_c147_p4s06v18_scratch.log:1040`, structural PASS 22/0).
- **B4 (already measured):** Not applicable.

**Part C: user rules**
